WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:02.430
Though incomplete,

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:06.370
Yoshimori activated his Zekkai
during his fight with Kaguro.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:25.690
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.560
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:32.760
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.660
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.100
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:42.500
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:46.040
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.380
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:55.040
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.550
Sha la la la la...

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:05.960
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.930
(Secret romance)

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:13.130
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:14.900
(A strange distance)

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:21.740
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:22.810
Yeah

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:26.280
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:29.880
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:35.220
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.750
That explosion must
be from Kaguro...

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.810
That's going to be
bad news for the kid...

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.170
Don't tell me that was
the best you can do!

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.710
Great. This is great!
All right!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.480
Let's quit right here.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:41.020
Because I think it will
be better if I wait.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:44.690
Your power is increasing and
your timing is getting better.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.890
I didn't think you could
deflect that attack

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.330
with your incomplete Zekkai.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.060
I put a lot of strength into it.

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:58.800
I want to see you
perfect it someday.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.270
I was still a human without
any special powers

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.040
when I last saw the Zekkai,

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.570
so I couldn't do
anything against it.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:10.480
That's why I want to fight you
when you perfect it.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.250
Don't give me that!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:16.120
Oh, want me to tell you
what I like best about you?

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.690
Listen to me!

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:22.950
It's how you don't hesitate
when you use your powers.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.030
You're just like me.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.390
You're the type that
continues to accelerate.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.270
You don't think of
the consequences,

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.470
you don't turn back,

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.670
and you never doubt
your own strength.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:35.270
One day,

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.900
you'll be beyond the comprehension
of everyone around you.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.910
You should already know this...

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.110
that what you must doubt
is the world itself.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.240
You're annoying!

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.650
I don't understand you.
And I don't want to.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:51.290
Don't you get tired of
doubting things so much?

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:56.790
That's why you've become
so twisted. Hah!

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.790
Could it be that...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:03:59.790
Huh?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:04.500
You really don't understand?
You've never felt it?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.770
You have so much power,

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:09.210
that it makes you
a foreign object in that world.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.610
You must feel out of place.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.140
Never.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.010
Fine.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.310
But you want to
become stronger, right?

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.850
Personally, I think you
should suffer more.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:27.090
Like, losing something
or someone you love.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.530
The illusion of something
being precious...

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.830
Throw away everything
including that illusion.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.940
By becoming completely alone
and not having anyone to depend on,

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.380
only then will you
become stronger.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:50.780
You're not weak like Shishio-kun.
You can make tough decisions.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:52.880
I can help you.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.620
Come to my side.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.060
I don't get you.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.130
You're blabbering
all this nonsense,

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.430
telling me to join you...

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:10.960
Doesn't that mean you want friends?

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:14.000
In the end, you don't
want to be alone. Is that it?

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.170
What did you say?

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:19.140
Neither Shishio nor I
would ever join

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.340
someone who has
abandoned his humanity.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:24.750
You're not strong.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:30.720
And don't you ever say
Shishio was weak!

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:40.160
An earthquake?!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:58.680
The castle's disintegration
is speeding up...

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.350
The fog is out, too.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.290
Looks like it's
about time to leave.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.700
What is this place?

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.970
This is the empty space
that enfolds the Other World.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.570
The world that lies ahead
is beyond human power.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.670
The Monster Fox of
the Black Pampas Grass

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:23.800
is the master of that world.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.870
Prepare yourself.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.120
What kind of Ayakashi

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.110
is the Monster Fox of
the Black Pampas Grass?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.650
I hear she used to live
in the world of humans.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.180
That entrance that Tokiko created...

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:39.720
That area used to be
a vast pampas grass field.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.930
The Monster Fox took up
residence there.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.960
One day,

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.940
she created that Other World
and became the master of it.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:52.700
But now that world
is falling apart.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.270
Yoshimori and the others
are in danger.

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.500
We must hurry.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.270
Why are you guys here?!

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:24.060
Don't leave us behind!

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:26.560
I'm fed up with you.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.710
You charged at Kaguro full force,

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.650
so I thought you had
some kind of plan.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.080
But you didn't have any!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.280
Can't you do more than
charge at him headfirst?

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:39.850
The only attacks that are really
affecting him are your words.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.380
Look at this.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.960
Tokine... what are those?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.860
The pieces of his swords that you
broke off with your Kekkai. Look.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.330
Look carefully. Ketsu!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.760
This is the first one.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:54.430
The next one.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.240
And the last one
that you broke off.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.740
They're getting
sharper and sharper.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.540
That's right.
The enemy is getting stronger.

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:10.310
Think of the attack
that blasted you here.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.190
You managed to deflect it.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.750
But his sword wasn't broken.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.230
You don't have to tell me.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:23.130
I'm the one fighting him.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:29.570
I know his swords are getting
sharper and he's getting stronger.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.830
I know that better than anybody.

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.270
The next one won't
even compare to this.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.140
He's going to come at you for real.
What are you going to do?

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.650
You can't even do
the Zekkai correctly.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.480
You know about the Zekkai,
Kagemiya?

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:47.440
It was from far away,
but I saw the Chief do it once.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:59.360
It does way more than just
blast you off when you touch it.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.840
It completely erases...
Nothing is left behind afterwards.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:11.170
It's that amazing?

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.010
It's more than amazing.

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:16.010
I only saw it from a distance
but it stopped me in my tracks.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.480
So if you can't even
break his sword,

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.210
you don't stand a chance.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.720
Kaguro isn't showing you
the full extent of his speed.

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:28.420
If you don't fortify your Zekkai,
you won't be able to make it.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.820
Get that through your head!
Though I doubt you can.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.070
What you're doing isn't courageous!
I won't accept it!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.370
Don't tell me
you're willing to die.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.040
His wounds are healing...

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:48.280
Hey, Kagemiya...

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:49.110
Huh?

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.480
Shishio was strong, right?

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.480
Yeah.

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:54.910
Then I have to go.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.480
Shishio will laugh at me
if I don't.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.490
Come on out, kid.

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:06.160
Come out!

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.570
In one strike...

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.920
See?! You can't win
against a monster like that!

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:32.520
I'm leaving! I don't even know why
I came here in the first place!

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:35.520
I'll never do something dangerous
like helping you ever again!

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:37.290
Kagemiya...

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:40.660
Thank you.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.240
What are you doing?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.410
Sorry.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.080
Yo-

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.480
Yoshimori!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.890
Kaguro!

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:16.330
Sorry, Tokine.
I'm just stupid after all.

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.400
Going in headfirst is
the only way I know.

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:20.630
Besides...

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.280
It won't mean anything
unless I attack him headfirst.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.080
You got some guts.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:39.010
But!

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:43.960
It'll be over in an instant.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:12:00.570
I know he's strong and
I'm not strong enough.

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:03.420
But even at the cost of my life...

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:04.410
I have to defeat him!

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:24.060
Like I said...

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:26.230
That's not enough!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.770
This isn't like me to do this.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.700
This plan isn't better...

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.570
Can I even block
his sword with this?

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:38.280
I've never fought anyone
so dangerous before!

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.520
It's his fault, for having
an incomplete technique!

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:45.290
I'll buy you some time,
so do it right.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.590
Man, I'm so stupid.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.630
I always wanted to do more
than just stay behind,

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:53.190
and watch other people's backs.

00:12:57.970 --> 00:12:59.600
That was all...

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:33.000
What happened?

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:34.330
Hurry, Mukade!

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:47.150
I know it...
I'm going to lose here...

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:53.220
Why? Why am I losing to those
who refuse freedom?

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:57.990
What do you people have?

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:03.930
What you have is what
I threw away long ago.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:08.930
Is that why?
Is it because I have nothing?

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:14.440
I don't know.
But I remember this feeling...

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.520
Back when my body had
unnecessary heat inside...

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:28.250
The feeling of
the moment I cut people.

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:33.030
I wanted that exciting moment
to last forever.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.140
But when I finally obtained
the eternal time...

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.110
I realized it wasn't
quite what I wanted.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.740
Yes, I finally remember.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:46.780
It's this feeling!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:12.930
Oh?
Where am I?!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.440
Zekkai?

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.770
What's going on?
Kai!

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:49.500
What is that?!

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:01.180
I knew he was a strange child.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.820
I thought he'd use
his power to destroy,

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.260
but he used it to
protect someone instead.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:12.660
Oh, my.
That shortened my life...

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.910
My wounds have healed...

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:43.460
Princess...

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:57.470
The dimension is
becoming more unstable.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:58.870
We have to hurry.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:00.900
Mukade, go faster.

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:02.780
This is as fast as I can go.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.190
Hey! There they are!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.560
Where? Where?!

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.890
Straight ahead!
The two of them are together!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:15.150
The two of them?
Yoshimori and Tokine-chan?

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:16.860
Um...

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.900
What about Sen?
Is everyone all right?

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:21.030
Say something, Hakota-kun!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.640
I don't know.
They're in something weird.

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:37.610
What is that?!

00:17:58.310 --> 00:17:58.960
That's...

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:00.360
Masamori-san!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:07.070
Mukade.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:07.840
Yes, sir.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:23.330
You're all right, Tokine-chan!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.260
They're in there!

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.390
What?!

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.360
Get closer, Mukade.

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:31.300
Yes, sir.

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:49.720
That's...

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:51.710
Yoshimori!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:53.820
Sen!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:55.430
Chief!

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:56.420
Are you all right?!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.450
What should I do?
He's...

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.130
There's something wrong with him!

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.760
Did... Yoshimori do this?

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:08.470
Probably. What is this?
It's not a Kekkai.

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:11.410
This is the first time
I've seen something like this.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.910
What should I do?
He's not breathing.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.410
He's not breathing?!

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:18.650
Don't!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.310
But...

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:20.780
It's too dangerous.

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:23.680
He probably overexerted himself
and collapsed.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.720
Yoshimori should be fine.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:31.260
This dense energy...
Is it just Yoshimori's?

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.030
It's not even Karasumori here.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.300
Chief! What should I do?!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:39.230
Mukade.

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.000
Yes, sir.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.340
Wait! Masamori!

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:45.800
I'll do something about it.

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:49.140
Hakudo!

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.610
Yes, sir!
Moon Blade!

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:59.220
My Moon Blade didn't even
leave a scratch!

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:00.690
I knew it.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.860
It'll destroy anything
that tries to intrude.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.960
In that sense,
it's the same as the Zekkai.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.770
But there's another
person inside,

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:08.860
so that's not it.

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:11.570
We can still communicate,

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.800
which means it's
not completely closed.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:20.470
It may be small, but there must
be an opening to break through.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.320
Sen! If Yoshimori
regains consciousness,

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.910
we might be able to
do something!

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:27.220
Try to wake him up!

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:28.710
Huh?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.820
I'll force it open
from the outside!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.490
Is that Masamori-san's Zekkai?

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:48.840
I'll open a hole with my Zekkai
and break it apart.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.210
There may be a chance that
I'll destroy his consciousness,

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.200
but we don't have time.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.110
Hey! Wake up!

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:57.080
Wake up! Come on!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.250
If I try to hold back,
I'll be swallowed instead!

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.230
It's evenly matched
with Masamori's Zekkai...

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:11.490
No, he's losing!

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.260
Y-Yoshimori!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:17.360
Hey!

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:19.130
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.030
Ketsu!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:23.240
Tokine-chan!

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:26.300
Damn!

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:36.020
Wake up! Please wake up!

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.750
Yoshimori! Wake up!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:41.520
Yoshimori...

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:53.930
Maybe that will do it...

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:58.610
Hey, you! Wake up!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.370
Wake up! I said, wake up!

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:11.080
If Yoshimori was in my position,
he wouldn't hesitate.

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:20.560
What are you trying to do?!

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.460
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:56.870
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.570 --> 00:23:01.170
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:05.600
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.410 --> 00:23:18.090
I feel like I could fly
for the one I love

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:26.830
Even if I search the whole world,
no one could replace you

00:23:27.530 --> 00:23:31.660
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:40.270
Don't cry

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:49.020
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:49.690 --> 00:23:53.850
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:53.890 --> 00:24:02.270
Don't cry
